# required-skills

Prefer repo-vendored skills under `.agents/skills/` (copied from `~/.cursor/skills`).

## Always useful

- `armin/armin-pre-check-task`
- `armin/armin-refresh-after-changes`
- `armin/armin-write-completion-report`
- `armin/armin-dev-policies`
- `ponytail/ponytail`
- `self-learning`
- `gitnexus/gitnexus-exploring` / `gitnexus-impact-analysis` / `gitnexus-debugging` (per root `AGENTS.md`)

## By surface

| Surface | Skills |
| --- | --- |
| API / Postgres / Docker | `database-schema-designer`, `armin/armin-local-t3-docker-deploy`, `security-baseline` |
| WebUI | `armin/armin-webui-curations`, `design-system-starter`, `frontend-component-build`, `mobile-native`, `impeccable`, `browser-act`, `armin/armin-webapp-functional-test` |
| Android | `qa-testing`, `qa-test-planner`, `session-handoff` (handoffs across API↔app) |
| API ↔ Web contracts | `backend-to-frontend-handoff-docs`, `frontend-to-backend-requirements` |
| Cleanup / git | `armin/code-pruning`, `armin/armin-github-commit-push`, `armin/armin-github-pull` |

Do not invent Desktop-only skill paths under `C:/Users/armin/.cursor/skills` on cloud workers — use `.agents/skills/` instead.
